<li>Renamed from GH Menu Stars to **Stargazer Bar**. New bundle identifier (`com.jazzyalex.StargazerBar`) and new appcast URL (`https://jazzyalex.github.io/stargazer-bar/appcast.xml`).</li>
<li>Reorganized Settings into tabs so the window fits without scrolling.</li>
</ul>
